  "body": "I'm running 0.19.0 built from source on centos, and was previously running a synapse 0.18.7 instance on a debian server using the official packages.  I'm not sure if this is related to a change between the package and the source install, or if it is a bug in the 0.19 release.  Regardless, in my config i have the line:\r\n\r\n```\r\nweb_client: False\r\n```\r\n\r\nYet the bundled web client is still running.\r\n\r\nOn my previous 0.18 instance, trying to access the server in a web browser opened a 404 error page with the message \"No such resource\".",
